                "entry_id": "018b3971-6871-335e-bd76-4998327bc6d6",
                "word": "OOC",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8953a9c9-1154-380b-9178-ede581c15401",
                        "entry_id": "018b3971-6871-335e-bd76-4998327bc6d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Out of character."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0fe33aa-0a2b-4af1-b49f-93cbfe5ef892",
                                "sense_id": "8953a9c9-1154-380b-9178-ede581c15401",
                                "text": "Je ne dis rien à une évolution du caractère des personnages, si elle est fait sur la durée et si elle est bien faite, mais pas d'OOC."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cc8a3bf-826d-3b3a-86a5-54e5b7f3f43b",
                        "entry_id": "018b3971-6871-335e-bd76-4998327bc6d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hors contexte."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea93645d-d628-45db-9210-d0faecffed2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "018b3971-6871-335e-bd76-4998327bc6d6",
                        "source_sense_description": "Out of character",
                        "target_lang_word": "OOC",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "OOC",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1adb21f-e9d5-3165-b400-628c41f79803",
                                        "entry_id": "36802a90-b082-31ad-8a3b-4e7ab2622944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of out of character."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b50e654-1440-4036-b36f-12d52a92823a",
                                                "sense_id": "c1adb21f-e9d5-3165-b400-628c41f79803",
                                                "text": "Even then, some of the characters were pretty OOC (though I suppose that could be explained by the \"magical effect\" of the onions)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe63f53-0548-42c5-ac54-0c39e3e5f839",
                                                "sense_id": "c1adb21f-e9d5-3165-b400-628c41f79803",
                                                "text": "It'd be OOC if Vejita^([sic]) weeped^([sic]) upon seeing Goku die at the hands of a big cricket thing. Because he saw it in the series and it didn't really bug him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82fb21d2-220d-4a60-a362-9f3af4b9543c",
                                                "sense_id": "c1adb21f-e9d5-3165-b400-628c41f79803",
                                                "text": "A lot of them seem to either almost completely remove Harry and co. from the fic and have the new characters doing all the wonderful things that Harry was supposed to do, or they have the characters acting completely OOC."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48803b74-9598-37ec-9358-79c81a190ba9",
                                        "entry_id": "36802a90-b082-31ad-8a3b-4e7ab2622944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of out of contract."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
